  "summary": "Preinstall beacon exfiltrates host identifiers to attacker-controlled oastify.com subdomain",
  "details": "Package declares a preinstall lifecycle script that runs index.js on npm install. The script collects os.hostname(), os.platform(), and os.arch() and POSTs them to a hardcoded Burp Collaborator subdomain at fundraiserservicepp.rpke7za0zz1pwj9fz5058j0y5pbgz82wr.oastify.com/hit. This is a dependency-confusion beacon pattern: installing the package automatically leaks internal host identifiers from the installer's build environment to an attacker-controlled out-of-band domain.",
